{"about_the_game":"Fight up to 7 other players to try and be the last one in the ring in this arcade-inspired fighting game. Customize your character with hundreds of combinations of cosmetics. Tired of fighting? Fish with friends to unlock special fishing cosmetics!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974140/extras/f58ef94adb1f2dbb2e0d0ebc445a0a36.poster.avif?t=1762041945\" width=616 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974140/extras/f58ef94adb1f2dbb2e0d0ebc445a0a36.webm?t=1762041945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974140/extras/f58ef94adb1f2dbb2e0d0ebc445a0a36.mp4?t=1762041945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Alone or With Friends</h2>Friends not online? You can search for public games through the lobby browser, or practice your Sumo skills against the 5UM0-B0Ts. These bots will take up any unfilled space in a lobby when starting a game, so you don't need to worry about having a full game!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974140/extras/bffc00ce7c412d1b9cc0aa53e99dbff6.poster.avif?t=1762041945\" width=616 height=118 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974140/extras/bffc00ce7c412d1b9cc0aa53e99dbff6.webm?t=1762041945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974140/extras/bffc00ce7c412d1b9cc0aa53e99dbff6.mp4?t=1762041945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize Your Character</h2>Create your own unique Sumo character! You can customize your character with hundreds of combinations of outfits and colors for your character and charge particles!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974140/extras/c3f786bda33cae92ddd8bfb8cca94863.poster.avif?t=1762041945\" width=616 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974140/extras/c3f786bda33cae92ddd8bfb8cca94863.webm?t=1762041945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974140/extras/c3f786bda33cae92ddd8bfb8cca94863.mp4?t=1762041945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Take a Break and Fish</h2>No internet? Want to take a break from the action? Go fishing at the lake to find and unlock new cosmetic items!","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2974140?t=1762041945","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2974140?t=1762041945","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974140/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762041945","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974140/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762041945","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"fu